      "text_preview": "By moving this application under Section 482 of Cr.P.C., the prayer is made to quash the entire proceedings of Case No.16899 of 2023 (State Versus Maroof) under Section 59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, Police Station Gal Shahee"
